#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_PhoebesRoom/scripts.inc:61
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_PhoebesRoom_Text_IntroSpeech"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha!\p"
"I'm PHOEBE of the ELITE FOUR.\n"
"I did my training on MT. PYRE.\p"
"While I trained, I gained the ability\n"
"to commune with GHOST-type POKéMON.\p"
"Yes, the bond I developed with POKéMON\n"
"is extremely tight.\p"
"So, come on, just try and see if you can\n"
"even inflict damage on my POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"啊哈哈哈！\p"
"我是四天王芙蓉。\n"
"我是在送神山修行的。\p"
"在修行中，我获得了与\n"
"幽灵属性宝可梦心灵相通的能力。\p"
"没错，我和宝可梦之间\n"
"培养出的羁绊是非常牢固的。\p"
"所以，来吧，试试看\n"
"你能不能伤到我的宝可梦吧！$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_PhoebesRoom/scripts.inc:72
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_PhoebesRoom_Text_Defeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, darn.\n"
"I've gone and lost.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，糟糕。\n"
"我输掉了。$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_PhoebesRoom/scripts.inc:76
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_PhoebesRoom_Text_PostBattleSpeech"
msgid ""
"There's a definite bond between you\n"
"and your POKéMON, too.\p"
"I didn't recognize it, so it's only\n"
"natural that I lost.\p"
"Yup, I'd like to see how far your bond\n"
"will carry you.\p"
"Go ahead, move on to the next room.$"
msgstr ""
"你和你的宝可梦之间\n"
"也有着确实的羁绊呢。\p"
"我没有察觉到这一点，\n"
"所以输了也是理所当然的。\p"
"嗯，我很想看看你们的羁绊\n"
"能带你们走多远。\p"
"去吧，前往下一个房间吧。$"
